<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2115_7923.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser freündt: nachparlich unnd guotwil-
<lb n="2"/>lige dienst, zuovor, fürsichtige, ersame,
<lb n="3"/>weise, besonders liebe freünd, unnd
<lb n="4"/>guote nachparn.
<lb n="5"/>Demnach unns, ein, von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sach</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>betreffend Ibellische erben, clägere
<lb n="7"/>sodan eweren lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitburger</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mich</unclear>-
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ael</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Scheblern</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beclagten</unclear>, außgang-
<lb n="9"/>ner compasbrief, eingelifert, dar-
<lb n="10"/>uber von dem clagenden thail, be-
<lb n="11"/>gert worden, unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgerin</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fraw</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Elisabeth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Scheblerin</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weilund</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> abgeleibten burgers
<lb n="14"/><persName resp="#ner">Hanns Schmutz</persName> seeligen hinderlaß-
<lb n="15"/>ne wittib, berüerts rechts han-
<lb n="16"/>dels halber, als von Ibellisch denomi-
<lb n="17"/>nirte gezeügin, zuverhören, alß
<lb n="18"/>unnd hierauf so haben wir zuo
<lb n="19"/>rechtens befürderung, solche
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeügen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhör</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uf</unclear> dato angesehen,
<lb n="21"/>bemelte Scheblerin für <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsere</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzuo</unclear> deputirte in unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">canz</unclear>-
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürbeschaiden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ob</unclear>-
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleichwoll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordnung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rech</unclear>-
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tens</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> außweisung compas-
<lb n="26"/>briefs, dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beclagten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schebler</unclear>,
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierzuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">offentliche</unclear> denun-
<lb n="28"/>ciation, beij aigner pottschafft,
<lb n="29"/>verkhündet, solche verkhündung
<lb n="30"/>auch, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inhalt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2115_7924.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rugg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelangten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">canzleÿ</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verferttigten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">recepiße</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> Schobler
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordenlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zehanden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khomen</unclear>, so ist
<lb n="34"/>doch seinthalb beÿ der production
<lb n="35"/>niemandts erschinen, sunder be=
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">melte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgerin</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Elisabeth
<lb n="37"/>Schoblerin</persName>, in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beÿsein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">clagen=</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>den theils <persName resp="#ner">Niclas v. Khollen</persName> und sein=
<lb n="39"/>er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwester</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgerin</unclear>
